OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and patchy rain will move
OL,6,Fsoutheastwards across England and
OL,7,FWales. Less warm than recently here
OL,8,Ftoo. Elsewhere it will be fresher with
OL,9,Fmore in the way of sunshine, though it
OL,10,Fwill be windy across Scotland with
OL,11,Fblustery showers.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy cloud giving a few
OL,14,Fearly evening showers across southeast
OL,15,FEngland. Clear periods elsewhere.
OL,16,FHowever, some cloud, and breezy in the
OL,17,Fnorth and northwest, with some
OL,18,Fshowers. Fresher for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
