OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FMostly dry in the south and
OL,6,Fsoutheast on Friday with some warm
OL,7,Fspells of sunshine. Cooler, with a
OL,8,Fbreeze towards the north and
OL,9,Fnorthwest, and a scattering of showers.
